{"id":2210,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>5月9日，中北大学航空宇航学院优秀心理委员答辩会于11107教室顺利举办。本次活动旨在加强心理委员队伍建设，表彰先进典型，筑牢班级心理健康防线。</p><p>大一各班心理委员依次上台，通过PPT汇报，围绕日常心理排查、班级心理建设、心理知识宣传、同学情绪帮扶等方面，展示履职成果、分享工作经验、反思不足并规划后续工作。段老师从工作实效、责任担当、沟通能力等维度进行综合考评，现场交流氛围浓厚。此次答辩充分展现了学院心理委员的责任与担当，进一步强化了朋辈心理互助力量，为学院心理健康教育工作高质量开展奠定坚实基础。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VMN-2iLzG8Lz7YMdNrVM7UDnln7LmN-DLm9YLzW2MRnVLzN0gihFp2hmCIa0MYyYU1yaokyiMRVRUll4LlCsLRNZnRvPMllaM4WRMRGZUmVFU494UzUaM4nFL4NYLR9Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aLzUsgtA8pUWcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10147&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/72B08541CAE31F7098D715E072C408B1/C83A4074/39208\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Vnmn2kUm7bLRUPMdN-aMRfRLmT2LmL-4LN-aM7-sLzvsM4v0gihFp2hmCIa0n1hkM1yaMYh2LR78o7W2UlU8U8-DLlMkU4vsnzW7UmUsM4fFM4-PnllDnRrFnR-8MlLJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aLzUsgtA8pUWcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10147&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VU8U2iLmGDLRfkUdzCsozfVLzQkozQ-Vozn7nz94UlUDnzU0gihFp2hmCIa0LShRokyZLYyPMzQkol7aMlnRU478nzvPM7UsoRliU4nkU8MFnl7iozCsMlWFLmCYMmUJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aLzUsgtA8pUWcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10147&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/1C883156B9A05DCC14E714D7855C4BCC/EA59675B/26264\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VU8U2iLmGDLRfkUdzCsozfVLzQkozQ-Vozn7nz94UlUDnzU0gihFp2hmCIa0LShRokyZLYyPMzQkol7aMlnRU478nzvPM7UsoRliU4nkU8MFnl7iozCsMlWFLmCYMmUJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aLzUsgtA8pUWcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10147&e=.jpg\"></p><p><br></p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://hkyh.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VMN-2iLzG8Lz7YMdNrVM7UDnln7LmN-DLm9YLzW2MRnVLzN0gihFp2hmCIa0MYyYU1yaokyiMRVRUll4LlCsLRNZnRvPMllaM4WRMRGZUmVFU494UzUaM4nFL4NYLR9Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aLzUsgtA8pUWcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10147&e=.jpg"}